<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <assignments>
        <name>Assign_Name_And_Key</name>
        <label>장비 이름·시리얼 키 채우기</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.Name</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>fxAssetName</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.SerialKey__c</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>fxSerial</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.SerialNumber</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>fxSerial</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
    </assignments>
    <description
  >26-10-14 장비 저장 전(생성·수정): 이름 = 모델/고객사/사업장/시리얼 끝자리(마지막 하이픈 뒤), 빈 칸은 건너뜀·모두 비면 "미지정 장비". 시리얼 키 = 일련번호(외부 ID·고유. 일련번호가 비면 시리얼 키를 일련번호로 채워 두 값을 같게). 생성, 또는 모델·고객사·사업장·일련번호·시리얼 키·이름이 바뀔 때 다시 만듦(장비 집계 저장 등에는 안 돎). 사업장·고객사 이름 변경 Flow는 이름을 "-"로 저장해 다시 만들게 함 by Edwin</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description
    >시리얼 = 일련번호. 일련번호가 비고 시리얼 키만 있으면(외부 ID upsert·예전 데이터) 시리얼 키를 일련번호로 → 두 값을 항상 같게</description>
        <name>fxSerial</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression
    >IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.SerialNumber}), {!$Record.SerialKey__c}, {!$Record.SerialNumber})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description
    >각 칸 앞에 "/"를 붙여 이음 (빈 칸은 건너뜀). 시리얼 끝자리 = 하이픈을 공백 100개로 바꾼 뒤 오른쪽 100자를 TRIM → 마지막 하이픈 뒤</description>
        <name>fxJoined</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression
    >IF(ISBLANK({!Get_Product.Name}), &quot;&quot;, &quot;/&quot; &amp; {!Get_Product.Name})
&amp; IF(ISBLANK({!Get_Account.Name}), &quot;&quot;, &quot;/&quot; &amp; {!Get_Account.Name})
&amp; IF(ISBLANK({!Get_Site.Name}), &quot;&quot;, &quot;/&quot; &amp; {!Get_Site.Name})
&amp; IF(ISBLANK({!fxSerial}), &quot;&quot;, &quot;/&quot; &amp; TRIM(RIGHT(SUBSTITUTE({!fxSerial}, &quot;-&quot;, RPAD(&quot; &quot;, 100, &quot; &quot;)), 100)))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description
    >앞의 "/" 하나를 떼고 255자로. 모두 비면 "미지정 장비" (이름은 필수)</description>
        <name>fxAssetName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression
    >IF(LEN({!fxJoined}) = 0, &quot;미지정 장비&quot;, LEFT(MID({!fxJoined}, 2, 300), 255))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel
  >장비 이름·시리얼 키 자동 {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>장비 저장 전 - 이름·시리얼 키 자동</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Product</name>
        <label>모델 가져오기</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound
    >true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Account</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Product2Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Product2</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Name</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Account</name>
        <label>고객사 가져오기</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound
    >true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Site</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.AccountId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Account</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Name</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Site</name>
        <label>사업장 가져오기</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound
    >true</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Assign_Name_And_Key</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.CustomerSite__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>CustomerSite__c</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Name</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Product</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterFormula
    >OR(ISNEW(), ISCHANGED({!$Record.Product2Id}), ISCHANGED({!$Record.AccountId}), ISCHANGED({!$Record.CustomerSite__c}), ISCHANGED({!$Record.SerialNumber}), ISCHANGED({!$Record.SerialKey__c}), ISCHANGED({!$Record.Name}))</filterFormula>
        <object>Asset</object>
        <recordTriggerType>CreateAndUpdate</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordBeforeSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
